KNOWNBUG with the headers of libstdc++ 16 (gcc 16) only; passes with gcc 11-15
headers.  Reproduce by preprocessing with g++-16 -E (the predefined macros
select the code paths) and running cbmc on the .ii file.  The typedef `_Node'
of _Node_traits is now kept as a lazily resolved member (register_lazy_member
under instantiation); the remaining failure is the node layout.
